      "zh": "這班公車有到市中心嗎？",
      "accept": ["Excuse me, does this bus go downtown?", "Is this bus going downtown?"],
      "note": "問「這班車有沒有到…」用 Does this bus go…?。downtown 前面不加 to，和 go home 一樣。",
